--   1. Read interior.furniture[].occupied to see if pet is seated
--   2. Send PetAPI/ExitFurnitureUseStates(petUnique)
--   3. Wait for occupied[] to clear (data-verified, not position)
--   4. Then HoldBaby via AdoptAPI/HoldBaby
-- ==================================================================
